   "why": "By hand, the audit session's ruling (2026-11-23): Conflagrate outside the kill shot only once Shadow and Flame keeps Immolate burning, i.e. from 39 (the module's default 3.0 cast it once Immolate had 3 seconds or less to run, and before Shadow and Flame 5/5 a Conflagrate ends the burn). No rule names Conflagrate (signature_spells.json gives Destruction no required spell, only a 60% share of seven core spells), and a talent whose play waits until its points are in has the precedent of Balance's ECLIPSE_GATE_RANK 3. A/B, the rules installed at 04:1x against CONFLAG_LEFT -1, 3,000 fights, seeds 1/2 (scratchpad conflag_gate_1123.py): 31 -5.2% / -5.1%, 33 -6.3% / -6.2%, 35 -4.3% / -4.6%, 38 -0.5% / -0.4%; 30 and 39-60 bit-identical; -1.32% / -1.32% level-weighted over 30-60. The Bane of Agony window of the same night ([8, 61] for [20, 61]) changes nothing from 20 on, so the A/B holds for these rules. The tune could not find it: CONFLAG_LEFT is not in warlock.ROTATION_KNOBS (for the optimality pass, with a cast while Shadow and Flame is 4/5, an 80% keep).",
